Subject: [PATCH] PendingIntent: accept hosted user, alarm and configuration authorities

Keep the pinned record identity, cancellation ordering, permission checks and
AM/ATM dispatch. The host has no full UserController, ActivityManagerConstants
or alarm daemon; the session supplies current-user and warning settings and
removes canceled alarms through its existing alarm authority.

